  "description": "Julietta, born as an illegitimate child of a nobility, is raised in an opera theatre to hide away from the eyes of the noble’s main wife.\n\nTo pay back her debt, she turns into a servant and challenges the high paying job that nobody could withstand.\n\nBut her special charm could not be hidden with clothing, as she catches the attention of the crown prince. Unlike other woman who flock to him, she was brutally honest. But why was he so bothered by her?\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nNaver Series: [Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=6871245), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=6863321)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=808711), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9656109)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003180)",
